branchpilot (1.0.0~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Visual commit graph with persistent lane assignment, colour-coded ref
    chips and incremental loading.
  * Syntax-highlighted diffs with file-level and hunk-level staging.
  * Commit flow with amend support and a per-commit detail pane.
  * Branch, stash and merge operations with in-app conflict resolution.
  * Fetch, pull and push with streaming progress and cancellable tasks.
  * Interactive rebase with a drag-and-drop todo editor and conflict resume.
  * Tags, cherry-pick, revert, reset, worktrees and per-file history.

